change_type: instructions+docs   changelog: - Operates Autobound through the OOMOL `oo` CLI with server-side credential injection. - Provides read-focused account, signal type, company search, and contact search actions. - Supports company enrichment with Autobound company-level signals. - Supports contact enrichment with contact-level signals and employer context. - Requires live schema inspection before each action payload to match authoritative connector inputs.  Source: `oomol-lab/skills@146ef20`

